    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by subsection (2) of section 7 of the Bank of Ceylon Ordinance (Chapter 397), I, RaviKarunanayake, Minister of Finance, do by this Order determine that the paid-up capital of the Bank of Ceylon shall beincreased from Rupees Five Billion to Rupees Ten Billion.",
